    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Uncommon (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>A <em>Hearthstone</em> teleports you to a destination set in advance—usually an inn. Activating the stone takes 1 minute and a Magic action; you appear in an unoccupied space within 30 feet of the destination you set.</p><p>While you are at an inn (or another place the DM allows), you can take a Magic action to make that place the destination of the Hearthstone’s teleportation. It stays your destination until you change it.</p><p>One <em>Hearthstone</em> doesn’t count against the number of magic items you can be attuned to.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-fSGjdnHJloWnAHvV\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Harmonisée, la pierre augmente de 1 votre nombre maximal d’objets harmonisés, pour ne pas compter dans la limite.</p></section>",
